{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14106320","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14106320","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410632001:0":{"text":"なるほど。ここはオルムエッグの運搬エリアか。ならあれが見張りだったのも納得だ。","source_cn":"原来如此，这里是龙蛋的运输区啊。怪不得会有那个小家伙守着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3307E9D68D2CC7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410632002:0":{"text":"侵入者がいないときは、レールの整備をしてるんだろうな。","source_cn":"我估计没有入侵者的时候，它负责维护这里的运输轨道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04B38E3EFA700FFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410632003:0":{"text":"レールの先に何があるのかを知る必要がある。","source_cn":"我要知道这条轨道的源头是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E5159CEC146E08B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410632004:0":{"text":"卵が奥から運ばれているのなら、竜もそこにいるかもしれない。","source_cn":"既然龙蛋都是从深处运出来的，龙可能就在那里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9439180A2CA4CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410632005:0":{"text":"ああ！マグマの湖だろうと渡ってみせる！何としてでも真相を突き止めるんだ！","source_cn":"你说得没错！就算是熔岩湖，我们也得想法子过去了。势在必行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F4366145F3D940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f